{"meta":{"id":"scaffolds","category":"aide/modules","title":"프로젝트 스캐폴드","subtitle":"(소규모/중규모/대규모)","summary":"규모별(소규모/중규모/대규모) 빈 스캐폴드 모음","tags":["aide","모듈","스캐폴드"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-commands","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-50 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-200/60 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>\n      3-modules\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Reusable Modules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    프로젝트 스캐폴드 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-teal-600 font-serif\">(소규모/중규모/대규모)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-100 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 규모별 폴더 구조 + 최소 보일러플레이트만 담은 빈 스캐폴드 — 새 프로젝트는 여기서 복사해서 시작\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">스캐폴드 자체는 콘텐츠 파일이 없는 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">복사용 산출물</strong>이다 — 규칙/이유는 각 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">1-rules/프로젝트/*.md</code>에 있다</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">이 myWiki 프로젝트가 실제로 소규모 스캐폴드를 그대로 복사</strong>해서 만들어졌다 — 0-docs/1-configs/2-frontEnd/3-backend/4-data/5-rules/logs/deploy 폴더 구조가 정확히 일치</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">규모별 스캐폴드</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">3종</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[26%]\">스캐폴드</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[74%]\">구성</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">소규모</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">서버 2개 스캐폴드 — 0-docs/1-configs/2-frontEnd(components,pages)/3-backend(main.py,routers,modules)/4-data/5-rules/deploy/logs</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">중규모</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">서버 3개 이상 스캐폴드 — 백엔드 app/(도메인별)+data_server/, 프론트 app/routes+features/</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">대규모</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">우산 레포 스캐폴드 — 0-etc/0-set/0-layout + 프로젝트별 하위 폴더</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">더 자세히</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">각 규모의 선택 기준·다음 단계 신호는 <a class=\"text-teal-700 font-semibold underline\" href=\"#/page/aide/common-rules/project-scale\">1-rules → 프로젝트 규모</a> 페이지에 비교표로 정리되어 있습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Reusable Modules</span>\n  <span>프로젝트 스캐폴드</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/modules/scaffolds","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"modules","title":"3-modules (재사용 모듈)","path":"aide/modules"}],"hasImage":false}